% Infinitival relative clauses whose head noun is an instrument of the clause
% (a knife to cut it with); the construction supplies a 'with_p' relation
% sharing its label with the clause.
%
% ERS fingerprint (https://delph-in.github.io/docs/erg/ErgSemantics_InstrumentalRelatives/):
%   h:with_p[ARG1 e, ARG2 x]
%   h:[ARG0 e]
%   h:[ARG0 x]

pattern { W [pred="with_p"]; W -[1=ARG1, post=EQ]-> E; W -[1=ARG2]-> X }
